sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Entry as connect
  participant Client
  participant Api as API source
  participant Http as Public API
  participant Load
  User->>Entry: connect()
  Entry->>Api: create, token read from CIVIQHUB_TOKEN
  Entry-->>User: client
  User->>Client: project()
  Client->>Api: fetch(container, exposure)
  Api->>Http: GET what the token covers
  Http-->>Api: scope and as-of
  Api->>Http: GET project
  loop each section, each page
    Api->>Http: GET proposals, revisions, amendments, arguments, vote aggregates
    Http-->>Api: rows and next cursor
  end
  Api->>Http: GET participation
  Api-->>Client: rows of one load
  Client->>Load: build and check invariants
  Load-->>Client: load
  Client-->>User: Project as of t
